{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/cc3e8a5055dd42cc532158de430c2b7d.avif?t=1756579948\" width=780 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the very heart of a remote forest stands a church long forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a young nun who has come here to breathe new life into the sacred place. At the same time, you keep a video blog: filming your daily life, speaking about the power of faith, and sharing biblical wisdom to inspire the younger generation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, this mission quickly turns into a nightmare. The forest is full of evil spirits, lost souls, and dark secrets. Every step is a test of faith and heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this forest, only those whose faith is truly strong will survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/029945fc425dd658c420f74d4771bb68.poster.avif?t=1756579948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/029945fc425dd658c420f74d4771bb68.webm?t=1756579948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/029945fc425dd658c420f74d4771bb68.mp4?t=1756579948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/ad45c4408f6f068b5577168ef3995295.avif?t=1756579948\" width=780 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main feature of the game is the voice prayer mechanic in any language in the world. Connect a microphone and say prayers aloud \u2014 the neural network, or God Himself, will determine whether your words are sincere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pray for the peace of lost souls \u2014 and free them from torment. Ask God for help \u2014 and He will show you the way. Recite sacred words to banish demons and cleanse cursed places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/9b6564e92defe87d6e6170ff4454eab4.poster.avif?t=1756579948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/9b6564e92defe87d6e6170ff4454eab4.webm?t=1756579948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/9b6564e92defe87d6e6170ff4454eab4.mp4?t=1756579948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful \u2014 prayer does not always save. Sometimes it is better to keep still and remain silent: a scream or an extra word can cost you your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;Silence is your shield. Prayer is your sword.&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/df87550031934b36998f2dff7a9a47e1.poster.avif?t=1756579948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/df87550031934b36998f2dff7a9a47e1.webm?t=1756579948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/df87550031934b36998f2dff7a9a47e1.mp4?t=1756579948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/7acd9995a8b3173c72e73680f544b1a3.avif?t=1756579948\" width=780 height=140 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice prayer mechanic in any language in the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic walking simulator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump scares that will make your heart sink</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constant psychological tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-save system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Excellent sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark continuation of the story begun in <strong><i>SNAP SNAP</i></strong> and <strong><i>10:59</i></strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/6081a14155a5699cd975cf99728f3d10.poster.avif?t=1756579948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/6081a14155a5699cd975cf99728f3d10.webm?t=1756579948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/6081a14155a5699cd975cf99728f3d10.mp4?t=1756579948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/59c65ef7a01a29103623111baf1e9ebc.avif?t=1756579948\" width=780 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A microphone and internet connection are required to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains puzzles, jump scares, and stories related to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are not a fan of this genre, we do not recommend playing this game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game features machine translation.</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953440?t=1756579948","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/c5a05bf549b416de618ac084b06efa3b571019ae/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756579948","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/8bd945c0364cae7be966b35811668da1e46eacf2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756579948","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/8bd945c0364cae7be966b35811668da1e46eacf2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756579948","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/cc3e8a5055dd42cc532158de430c2b7d.avif?t=1756579948\" width=780 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the very heart of a remote forest stands a church long forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a young nun who has come here to breathe new life into the sacred place. At the same time, you keep a video blog: filming your daily life, speaking about the power of faith, and sharing biblical wisdom to inspire the younger generation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, this mission quickly turns into a nightmare. The forest is full of evil spirits, lost souls, and dark secrets. Every step is a test of faith and heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this forest, only those whose faith is truly strong will survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/029945fc425dd658c420f74d4771bb68.poster.avif?t=1756579948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/029945fc425dd658c420f74d4771bb68.webm?t=1756579948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/029945fc425dd658c420f74d4771bb68.mp4?t=1756579948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/ad45c4408f6f068b5577168ef3995295.avif?t=1756579948\" width=780 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main feature of the game is the voice prayer mechanic in any language in the world. Connect a microphone and say prayers aloud \u2014 the neural network, or God Himself, will determine whether your words are sincere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pray for the peace of lost souls \u2014 and free them from torment. Ask God for help \u2014 and He will show you the way. Recite sacred words to banish demons and cleanse cursed places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/9b6564e92defe87d6e6170ff4454eab4.poster.avif?t=1756579948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/9b6564e92defe87d6e6170ff4454eab4.webm?t=1756579948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/9b6564e92defe87d6e6170ff4454eab4.mp4?t=1756579948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful \u2014 prayer does not always save. Sometimes it is better to keep still and remain silent: a scream or an extra word can cost you your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;Silence is your shield. Prayer is your sword.&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/df87550031934b36998f2dff7a9a47e1.poster.avif?t=1756579948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/df87550031934b36998f2dff7a9a47e1.webm?t=1756579948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/df87550031934b36998f2dff7a9a47e1.mp4?t=1756579948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/7acd9995a8b3173c72e73680f544b1a3.avif?t=1756579948\" width=780 height=140 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice prayer mechanic in any language in the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic walking simulator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump scares that will make your heart sink</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constant psychological tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-save system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Excellent sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark continuation of the story begun in <strong><i>SNAP SNAP</i></strong> and <strong><i>10:59</i></strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/6081a14155a5699cd975cf99728f3d10.poster.avif?t=1756579948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/6081a14155a5699cd975cf99728f3d10.webm?t=1756579948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/6081a14155a5699cd975cf99728f3d10.mp4?t=1756579948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/extras/59c65ef7a01a29103623111baf1e9ebc.avif?t=1756579948\" width=780 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A microphone and internet connection are required to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains puzzles, jump scares, and stories related to death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are not a fan of this genre, we do not recommend playing this game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game features machine translation.</strong></h2>","developers":[" Beshbarmak games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953440/b13ef4b6eae9b590e0668c2fd079fd77d022e07b/header.jpg?t=1756579948","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</st